  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Seamlessly Integrate Amazon EventBridge with Your Camunda Workflows",
    "splashDescription": "Integrate Amazon EventBridge, the serverless event bus service, into your Camunda processes with this versatile connector. Whether you're receiving events for Camunda process triggers or sending events to interact with other AWS services, this Connector makes it straightforward to set up a powerful event-driven architecture.",
